# Design System

Astro + vanilla CSS only. Tokens live in `src/styles/global.css` (`:root` + `[data-theme="dark"]`).

## Direction

- Personal brand site for **Krystian Hanek / Hanek Software** - engineer portfolio, not a SaaS marketing template.
- Prefer a distinctive technical/editorial look over generic startup UI.
- When redesigning, replace the legacy Inter + violet/orange gradient look with a clearer direction (new fonts + restrained accent). Do not ship purple-on-white AI defaults.

## Tokens

- Colors: `--color-bg`, `--color-text`, `--color-text-secondary`, `--color-accent`, `--color-border`, `--color-card-bg`, shadows.
- Spacing: `--spacing-xs` … `--spacing-xl`.
- Type: `--font-family` (and optional `--font-display` if added); sizes via existing `--font-size-*` or `clamp()`.
- Layout: `--max-width`, `--content-width`.
- Always change look through variables first; avoid hardcoding hex in components.

## Composition

- Hero: name as primary brand signal, one title, one subtitle, one CTA.
- Full-bleed/atmospheric hero background OK; no inset hero cards or floating badges.
- Sections: one purpose each (About, Skills, Projects, Contact).
- Cards only when they aid scanning interactive/content groups - not by default.
- Light + dark must both remain intentional after token changes.
- Keep `print.css` usable when touching global type/color.

## Do not

- Add Tailwind, CSS frameworks, or React islands for styling
- Use Inter/Roboto/Arial as the primary redesign font
- Clutter the first viewport with stats, icon grids, or promo chips
